{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmcnbvx4ms00","created":1792802172127,"text":"呼吸功能不全\nrespiratory insufficiency"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnd623xxk0","created":1792802272561,"text":"1.概念"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcne0nu0wg0","created":1792802339178,"text":"（1）呼吸功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcne7zlirc0","created":1792802355126,"text":"在影响外呼吸功能的疾病发展过程中，当呼吸负荷加重时\nPaO2⬇或伴有PaCO2⬆，并出现相应的体征和症状","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnfnjfcu80","created":1792802467342,"text":"（2）呼吸衰竭"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnft1bpcw0","created":1792802479308,"text":"机体在海平面静息时吸入空气的条件下，\n由于外呼吸功能严重障碍\n导致PaO2＜60mmHg，或伴有PaCO2＞50mmHg，\n同时有呼吸困难表现","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#ffff00","color":"#ff0000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnhpwvc9c0","created":1792802629236,"text":"标准制定：氧离曲线、二氧化碳解离曲线"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnji21kcg0","created":1792802768863,"text":"氧离曲线","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/c7f925ba27a593f329671bd5465adf61/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":154}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnjmaoe0g0","created":1792802778092,"text":"二氧化碳解离曲线","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/00839b66a4fc83520f880dab422db20f/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":138}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnkhab2t40","created":1792802845550,"text":"标准数值：RFI呼吸衰竭指数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnky7gnm00","created":1792802882383,"text":"计算：RFI=PaO2/FiO2(氧分压/氧浓度)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnlc6154o0","created":1792802912772,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}